{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas is coming! That means it\u2019s time to dive into the holiday spirit with the new game Find All Things: Christmas. This time, you\u2019ll explore a variety of themed locations filled with Christmas magic and an even wider selection of mini-games. Set up a cozy festive room or head to Santa\u2019s workshop to help the elves assemble toys \u2014 there\u2019s something for everyone! Play mini-games, search for hidden objects, beat match-3 levels, complete puzzles, and solve riddles \u2014 all in one game! For every level you complete, you\u2019ll earn coins that you can use to unlock collectible items for your room. In this game, everyone will find something they enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948410/extras/e61c9d395dbd1f6c4b9e6f48f4bdbd3d.poster.avif?t=1755270131\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948410/extras/e61c9d395dbd1f6c4b9e6f48f4bdbd3d.webm?t=1755270131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948410/extras/e61c9d395dbd1f6c4b9e6f48f4bdbd3d.mp4?t=1755270131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exciting journey with a variety of mini-games and puzzles that will never let you get bored.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Play 80 different levels in 20 themed locations<br>\u2714 Find hidden objects and match pairs<br>\u2714 Relax and unwind with soothing gameplay<br>\u2714 Build puzzles and solve various brain teasers<br>\u2714 Decorate the room with collectibles<br>\u2714 Discover tons of great desktop wallpapers<br>\u2714 Listen to game tunes in the music player</p>","background":"https://store.a